# Ace Studio Creator Dashboard — environment
# Copy to .env and fill in. NEVER put the Supabase service-role (secret)
# key in this app — it bypasses Row Level Security and must never be in
# a browser app, in code, or in git. Only the publishable key goes here.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=YOUR-PUBLISHABLE-KEY-HERE

# Optional: the ONE email allowed into the creator dashboard. It
# defaults to kennethkalizibegoddynatus@gmail.com in src/lib/admin.ts —
# set this only if the creator's email ever changes. Exactly one
# email, ever — never a list. An email is contact information, not a
# secret, so it is safe to keep here.
# VITE_CREATOR_ADMIN_EMAIL=kennethkalizibegoddynatus@gmail.com
